    "sourceWikitext": "{{recipe summary\n| category = Beverage recipes\n| servings = approximately 48\n| yield = 6 cups\n| time = 5 minutes\n| difficulty = 1\n| image = \n| energy = \n| note = \n}}{{recipe}}\n==Ingredients==\n*4 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] nonfat dry [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]] powder\n*1 cup [[Cookbook:Cocoa Powder|cocoa powder]]\n*1 cup [[Cookbook:White Sugar|white sugar]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Combine all ingredients.\n# Mix thoroughly.\n# Store in an airtight container.\n\n==Use==\nFor each serving of hot cocoa, add 2 heaping teaspoons of cocoa mix to 1 cup of hot [[Cookbook:Water|water]], and stir until smooth.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using cocoa powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered milk]]",
